# Bytes are local-only: 217-file recovered runtime tree plus model_149999.pt (26,367,345 B,
# sha256 a9d31dce...3d5450), 111 MB total. Identity, the pinned machine-dog commit 8c3fdffa,
# the reason that commit cannot export them, per-file SHA-256 in SHA256SUMS.txt, and
# regeneration instructions are all tracked in
# references/upstream/2026-09-11_lite3_v12_locomotion/SOURCE.md.
# NOTE: these bytes are ALREADY ignored by the pre-existing references/upstream/.gitignore
# rule `**/source/`. The entry below is deliberately redundant, so that a 111 MB local-only
# artifact is documented alongside the repository's other large-byte exceptions rather than
# being invisible here. Removing it does not un-ignore anything.
/references/upstream/2026-09-11_lite3_v12_locomotion/source/

